Package: barclaw
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: chaseungjoon <cktmdwns604@cau.ac.kr>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/sjcsoftware/barclaw
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, python3-cairo, python3-cryptography, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-soup-3.0
Recommends: x11-utils, tesseract-ocr, python3-venv, pipewire-bin | pulseaudio-utils | alsa-utils, fonts-noto-color-emoji, fonts-lmodern, gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Suggests: gir1.2-gtklayershell-0.1, grim
Description: Talk to your OpenClaw agent from the Linux menu bar
 A menu bar app for an OpenClaw gateway: hold a key to speak, watch replies
 stream in as Markdown, math, charts, and images, and let your agent read
 your screen on request.
